Flexible Model-to-Agent Mapping

Status: Accepted

Context:
- Local execution requires resource optimization.
- Concurrent Workflows may share the same model, or use different models.
  This leads to resource contention and concurrency bottlenecks at scale.

Decision:
- Orchestrator must support both one to many and many to many model deployments.
  - One to Many: One model pod service multiple Agent pods in Workflows.
  - Many to Many: Models deployed per need for dedicated or high security tasks.

Consequences:
- Complicates VRAM management; Orchestrator must implement a ledger system to 
  track loaded models along with VRAM usage for KV cache needs by each agent.
- Requires warm models to lower latency.

